    "text": "WSFA\nwebsite\nMontgomery\nUnion representing Montgomery Fire and Rescue asks for wages increase\nBy Emma Ellis,\n2 hours agoMONTGOMERY, Ala. (WSFA) - Some Montgomery firefighters have called upon the City Council to deliver a fair, competitive pay increase. However, city leaders argue that the pay is already competitive. The Local 1444 Union that represents Montgomery Fire and Rescue says its members aren’t making a competitive enough wage, and...\n2",
